      },
      "text": "**Calculating multiples and weather**\n\nI need to calculate the number of positive multiples of 3 below 100, which gives me the range 1 to 99. I find 33 multiples of 3, and for 7, there are 14. Both being multiples of 21 means 4 overlaps. So the exact count of odd numbers is 33 + 14 - 2 times 4, giving me 39. Then I want to check the weather in Lima, so I'll call the appropriate tool for that."
    }
